# 🛡️ Anti-Theft Open Source Dual License & Copyright Protection Notice

Copyright (c) 2024-present **Amr Sherif Abdelaal** (@AmrSherifCodes). All rights reserved.

This project ("Thinking Bridge / Thinking English™ / فكّر إنجليزي") is governed by a **3-Tier Anti-Theft Open Source Architecture** designed to keep the application 100% free and open-source forever, while making it impossible for third parties to privatize, paywall, monetize, or steal the project's codebase, educational content, or brand identity.

---

## Tier 1 — Software Code: GNU Affero General Public License v3 (AGPL-3.0-or-later)

All software source code, engine logic, UI components, algorithms, build scripts, and local database schemas are licensed under the **GNU Affero General Public License v3 (AGPL-3.0-or-later)**.

- **Strict Copyleft Enforcement**: Anyone who uses, modifies, forks, redistributes, or hosts this app (on web servers, mobile app stores, or SaaS wrappers) **MUST** open-source their entire modified codebase under the exact same AGPL-3.0-or-later license.
- **Anti-Closed Source Guarantee**: Closed-source proprietary forks, paywalled wrappers, or hiding source code changes are legally prohibited.

---

## Tier 2 — Pedagogical Content & Curricula: Creative Commons CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

All educational lessons (27 interactive structural bridge lessons, 4,090+ flashcards, prebuilt decks, curated lexicons, phonetic guides, and pedagogical explanations) are licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)**.

- **Attribution (BY)**: Mandatory attribution to **Amr Sherif Abdelaal** in all copies or adaptations.
- **NonCommercial (NC)**: No person or entity may sell, paywall, or commercially monetize the educational content or curriculum without explicit written consent.
- **ShareAlike (SA)**: Any derivative educational works must be shared under the exact same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 open license.

---

## Tier 3 — Brand Identity & Trademarks (TM / ®)

The names **"Thinking Bridge"**, **"Thinking English"**, **"فكّر إنجليزي"**, the official logo, visual brand assets, and the primary domain `tb-eg.vercel.app` are trademarks of **Amr Sherif Abdelaal**.

- **Anti-Impersonation**: Open source software licenses do **NOT** grant trademark rights.
- **Mandatory Rebranding**: Any fork or redistribution **MUST** remove all official logos and rebrand under a distinct name to prevent impersonation or misleading users on app stores and search engines.

